OL,3,AUS ban on Canadian alcohol and dairy
OL,4,Atakes effect as trade war drags on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US ban on several Canadian imports,
OL,7,Fincluding alcohol, dairy and
OL,8,Fmotorcycles, has come into effect as a
OL,9,Ftrade war between the two neighbours
OL,10,Fdrags on.
OL,12,FThe latest measure by the Trump
OL,13,Fadministration is in response to
OL,14,FCanada's implementation of tariffs on a
OL,15,Frange of US goods earlier this month
OL,16,Ffollowing a breakdown in trade talks.
OL,18,FCanada is not expected to retaliate
OL,19,Ffurther, with Prime Minister Mark
OL,20,FCarney saying earlier this month that
OL,21,Fthe impact the import bans will have on
OL,22,FCanada's economy is "modest".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
