OL,3,AUS ban on Canadian alcohol and dairy
OL,4,Atakes effect as trade war drags on
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade talks remain on ice, with US
OL,7,Ftrade representative Jamieson Greer
OL,8,Ftelling CNBC recently that President
OL,9,FDonald Trump is "comfortable" with his
OL,10,Fcurrent relationship with Canada.
